{
  "book": "Psa", "book_id": 19, "chapter": 32, "provenance": "reread-psalms-2026",
  "note": "Ps32 (28 chars). Penitential. Three sin-words pesha/chattath/avon: forgiven (v1-2), confessed (v5). Double esher beatitude. ruach no deceit. shaagah groaning of silence. yada acknowledge + yadah confess. chesed surrounds the truster. joy-cluster v11 (samach/gil/ranan). Poetic ledger; span-id pairs.",
  "spans": {
    "276872": {"gloss":"Blessed v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"blessed / happy (esher)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the one whose transgression is forgiven","from":276872,"to":276873,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'BLESSED (esher) is the one whose transgression is forgiven' — the beatitude of the pardoned; esher (as Ps1:1) the deep happiness not of the sinless but of the forgiven, the psalm's opening note"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276873": {"gloss":"transgression v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"transgression / rebellion (pesha, forgiven)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the blessed one","to":276873,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"forgiven / lifted","to":276873,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with covered sin","from":276873,"to":276875,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'whose TRANSGRESSION (pesha) is forgiven' — rebellion lifted away; pesha (as Ps19:13) the first of the three sin-words, the willful breach now borne off, forgiven"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276875": {"gloss":"sin v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"sin (chattath, covered)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the blessed one","to":276875,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"covered","to":276875,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with forgiven transgression","from":276875,"to":276873,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'whose SIN (chattath) is covered' — the sin hidden from view; chattath (missing the mark) the second sin-word, now covered over by God, blotted from sight"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276892": {"gloss":"Blessed v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"blessed / happy (esher)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the man against whom no iniquity is counted","to":276892,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'BLESSED (esher) is the man against whom the LORD counts no iniquity' — the second beatitude; esher doubled, the happiness of the one whose iniquity God does not reckon and whose spirit is guileless"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276895": {"gloss":"counts v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"count / reckon (chashab, negated)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":276895,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"count / reckon (negated)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"iniquity","from":276895,"to":276897,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"negated ('counts NO iniquity')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'against whom the LORD COUNTS (chashab) no iniquity' — non-imputation of guilt; chashab (as Ps21:11 of the wicked's scheming; here God's reckoning) negated — God does not charge the sin to the pardoned's account"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276897": {"gloss":"iniquity v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquity (avon)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the blessed man (not counted to him)","to":276897,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"not counted","to":276897,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"not reckoned by God","from":276897,"to":276895,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'counts no INIQUITY (avon)' — the third sin-word, not reckoned; avon (guilt/crookedness) completes the triad pesha/chattath/avon, all three now unimputed"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276898": {"gloss":"spirit v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"spirit (ruach - in whose spirit no deceit)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"spirit (self)","to":276898,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the blessed man","to":276898,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"in which there is no deceit","from":276898,"to":276900,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'in whose SPIRIT (ruach) there is no deceit' — the guileless inner self; ruach (as Ps31:5) here the spirit purged of self-deception, honest before God — the forgiven no longer hides sin"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276900": {"gloss":"deceit v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"deceit / guile (remiyah, negated)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the blessed man (without it)","to":276900,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"absent from the spirit","from":276900,"to":276898,"res":"span"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"negated ('no DECEIT in his spirit')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'no DECEIT (remiyah)' — self-honesty as the mark of the forgiven; remiyah = guile/slackness, negated — the spirit that no longer deceives itself about its sin, the opposite of the silence of v3"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276906": {"gloss":"groaning v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"groaning / roaring (shaagah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David (in his silence)","to":276906,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"all day long","to":276906,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'when I kept silent, my bones wasted away through my GROANING (shaagah) all day' — the agony of unconfessed sin; shaagah (as Ps22:1) the groan of the one who hides his guilt, the body wasting under silence"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276921": {"gloss":"acknowledged v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"acknowledge / make known (yada, hiphil)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276921,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"acknowledge"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"my sin (to God)","from":276921,"to":276922,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with not covering iniquity","from":276921,"to":276925,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I ACKNOWLEDGED (yada) my sin to you, and did not cover my iniquity' — the turn from silence to disclosure; yada here the owning of sin, the opposite of hiding it, the act that brings release"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276922": {"gloss":"sin(a) v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"sin (chattath - acknowledged)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276922,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"acknowledged to God","from":276922,"to":276921,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I acknowledged my SIN (chattath) to you' — the sin now named before God; chattath the first of the confession's three sin-words, brought into the open"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276925": {"gloss":"iniquity(a) v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquity (avon - not covered)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276925,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"not covered (by self)","to":276925,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with acknowledging","from":276925,"to":276921,"res":"span"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"not hidden ('I did NOT cover my iniquity')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I did not cover my INIQUITY (avon)' — the refusal to hide guilt; avon uncovered by the sinner (so that God may cover it, v1) — the paradox: he who hides sin is not covered, he who uncovers it is"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276927": {"gloss":"confess v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"confess (yadah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276927,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"confess"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"my transgressions (to the LORD)","from":276927,"to":276928,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I will CONFESS (yadah) my transgressions to the LORD' — the resolve to confess; yadah (the same root as give-thanks, Ps30) here confession, the open owning of sin that meets instant forgiveness ('and you forgave')"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276928": {"gloss":"transgressions v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"transgressions (pesha - confessed)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276928,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"confessed to God","from":276928,"to":276927,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'confess my TRANSGRESSIONS (pesha)' — the rebellions owned; pesha in the confession (as in the beatitude v1), the same sin-words that were forgiven now named by the sinner"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276932": {"gloss":"iniquity(b) v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquity (avon - of my sin, forgiven)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276932,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"forgiven","to":276932,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the forgiven sin","from":276932,"to":276933,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and you forgave the INIQUITY (avon) of my sin' — the guilt lifted the moment of confession; avon here forgiven, the immediate divine response to the owned sin"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276933": {"gloss":"sin(b) v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"sin (chattath - forgiven)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276933,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"forgiven","to":276933,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with forgiven iniquity","from":276933,"to":276932,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the iniquity of my SIN (chattath)' — the sin whose guilt is forgiven; chattath closing the confession's use of the triad — all three sin-words (pesha/chattath/avon) confessed and all forgiven, the psalm's central drama"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276937": {"gloss":"godly v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"godly / loyal (chasid)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"everyone who is godly","to":276937,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"summoned to pray","from":276937,"to":276938,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'let everyone who is GODLY (chasid) offer prayer to you at a time when you may be found' — the forgiveness generalised; chasid (the covenant-loyal) urged to seek God while he may be found, learning from the psalmist's confession"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276938": {"gloss":"offer prayer v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"pray / intercede (palal)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the godly","from":276938,"to":276937,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"pray"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"God","to":276938,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the godly","from":276938,"to":276937,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'offer PRAYER (palal) to you' — the response the forgiveness invites; palal = to pray/intercede, the godly urged to approach God in the accessible time, safe from the flood of great waters"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276957": {"gloss":"instruct v8","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"instruct / make wise (sakal)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (or the psalmist as teacher)","to":276957,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"instruct"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the hearer ('you')","to":276957,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"in the way you should go","to":276957,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I will INSTRUCT (sakal) you and teach you in the way you should go' — the divine tutoring of the forgiven; sakal = to give insight, God's promise to guide with his eye upon the pardoned (contrast the mindless beast, v9)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276969": {"gloss":"understanding v9","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"understanding / discernment (bin, negated of the beast)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the horse/mule (without it)","to":276969,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"absent ('without UNDERSTANDING')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Be not like a horse or mule, without UNDERSTANDING (bin)' — the warning against beastly senselessness; bin absent = the lack of discernment that must be curbed by bit and bridle, the opposite of the teachable forgiven heart"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276879": {"gloss":"wicked v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wicked (rasha)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (many sorrows)","to":276879,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"contrasted with the truster surrounded by chesed","from":276879,"to":276882,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:person"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Many are the sorrows of the WICKED (rasha), but steadfast love surrounds the one who trusts' — the contrast of two fates; rasha's many sorrows set against the chesed encircling the truster"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276880": {"gloss":"steadfast love v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"steadfast love (chesed)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":276880,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"surround","to":276880,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the one who trusts","from":276880,"to":276882,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"contrasted with the wicked's sorrows","from":276880,"to":276879,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'CHESED (steadfast love) surrounds the one who trusts in the LORD' — love encircling the truster; chesed here the encompassing favour of God around the trusting heart, replacing the many sorrows of the wicked"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276882": {"gloss":"trusts v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"trust (batach)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the one who trusts","to":276882,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"trust"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":276882,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"surrounded by chesed","from":276882,"to":276880,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the one who TRUSTS (batach) in the LORD' — trust as the condition of being encircled by love; batach the reliance that draws God's surrounding chesed, the opposite of the wicked's self-reliant sorrow"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276884": {"gloss":"glad v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be glad (samach)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the righteous","to":276884,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"be glad"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"in the LORD","to":276884,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with rejoicing","from":276884,"to":276886,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Be GLAD (samach) in the LORD, and rejoice, O righteous' — the summons to the forgiven's joy; samach opens the closing joy-cluster (samach/gil/ranan), gladness the fruit of pardon"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276886": {"gloss":"rejoice v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"rejoice / exult (gil)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the righteous","to":276886,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"exult"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with gladness","from":276886,"to":276884,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and REJOICE (gil), O righteous' — exultation joined to gladness; gil the leaping joy of the pardoned righteous, the second of the joy-cluster"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276887": {"gloss":"righteous v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"righteous (tsaddiq)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the righteous (called to joy)","to":276887,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"summoned to be glad","from":276887,"to":276884,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'O RIGHTEOUS (tsaddiq)' — the forgiven now called righteous; tsaddiq (as Ps31:18) here the pardoned reckoned just, summoned to the joy that pardon brings"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276888": {"gloss":"joy v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"shout for joy (ranan)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the upright in heart","from":276888,"to":276890,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"shout for joy"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"of the upright in heart","from":276888,"to":276890,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and SHOUT for JOY (ranan), all you upright in heart!' — the ringing cry of the pardoned; ranan (as Ps30:5's rinnah) the loud joy that seals the psalm, the third of the joy-cluster"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276890": {"gloss":"upright v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"upright (yashar - in heart)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the upright","to":276890,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"of the heart, called to shout","from":276890,"to":276891,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'all you UPRIGHT (yashar) in heart' — the straight-hearted summoned to joy; yashar (as Ps25:8) the uprightness now residing in the heart of the forgiven, the inner rectitude that shouts for joy"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276891": {"gloss":"heart v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heart (lev - upright in heart)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (self)","to":276891,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the upright","to":276891,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the seat of uprightness","from":276891,"to":276890,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'upright in HEART (lev)' — the heart as the seat of uprightness; lev here the inner centre made straight, from which the pardoned's joy rises, closing the psalm on the honest heart (contrast the deceit-free spirit of v2)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276913": {"gloss":"heavy-hand v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heavy (kabed - your hand heavy upon me)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v4: 'day and night your HAND was HEAVY (kabed) upon me; my strength dried up as by summer heat' - the weight of unconfessed sin as God's discipline; the divine hand pressing on the silent sinner, life-sap withering until confession brings release (v5)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]}
  }
